      "content": "I would not recommend taking leftover macrobid (nitrofurantoin) without consulting a doctor first, especially with stage 3 kidney disease. Nitrofurantoin is generally contraindicated in patients with severe kidney impairment and can exacerbate kidney damage. Vitamin C may not be effective in treating a UTI, and combining it with antibiotics without medical guidance can also be problematic. Consider consulting your doctor or a primary care physician to discuss proper treatment options and potential interactions.",
